{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-relics","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigRelic-33166","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"codex-relics-item-ItemConfigRelic-33166-item-ItemConfigRelic-33166-0","text":"伟如恒星般的岁阳始祖沉陷在无边梦境之中。在它的酣眠之中，周身的原子与分子碰撞激发，不断从焰轮铸炼的外壳结构中逸散出来，最终呈现为色彩纷呈的天绸光带。","speaker":""}]}
